gametitle=Madden NFL 2004 (SLUS-20752) [14F8B841]
comment=N-1 -- fold the helper's mass+strength into the primary's contest. Over P1+P4+P11.
// The keystone (docs/n1-cave.md, docs/drive-lanes/3-native-drive.md). At the
// sole contest lock-in (0x001F153C -> jal cave #4), if the defender is a live
// record's role-2 man, resolve the role-1 helper (record+0x04 handle via
// 0x0013B798) and add W+STR / AGI+STR/2 / W+STR+AWR+AGI into the primary's
// freshly stamped comps. AGI pinned as index 1 (PAGI) two independent ways.
// Gates: role-2, helper resolves, helper kind in {7,8}, record.primary==s0
// (an extra insurance the author added -- both insurances fail toward stock).
// 66 words in cave #4 (0x004F4AA0), re-censused DEAD on five axes by author
// AND coordinator independently. Canaries: 0x0051497C entry, 0x00514978 fold.
// ORACLE: the frame-23 shed the doubled DE currently WINS (P11 measured:
// handoff, clips 147->161, dy -1.41) should resolve into the driven-back
// family (ids 120-131). Must-not-move: slot 6, slot 7, any pair without a
// live record, and 3x determinism.

